   <refbody>
      <section id="sec_d405e20">
         <p>The <b>Fields</b> section of the Document Panel lists all smart fields in the agreement document.</p>
         <p>Use the Document Panel to take the following actions on fields in the document:</p>
         <ul>
            <li>
               <xref href="#workingwithfieldsviewchange">View and/or change values for all occurrences of a field.</xref>
            </li>
            <li>
               <xref href="#workingwithfieldsrejectchange">View and/or reject changed field values.</xref>
            </li>
            <li>
               <xref href="#workingwithfieldsvalidatefields">Validate field values.</xref>
            </li>
            <li>
               <xref href="#workingwithfieldsdeletefields">Mark fields for deletion.</xref>
            </li>
         </ul>
      </section>
   </refbody>
